{
  "id": "ss.base.shelf",
  "name": "The shelf",
  "description": "The seven boxes of paper (A055: \"Base inventory: the frame, the tank, seven boxes of paper, the saw.\"), stacked three, three and one in cold slate crates with steel corners, each numbered on its face in the expedition's way — a count of strokes, one to seven — and the bottom row with rope handles. Paper stands proud of every lid; the top box's lid is off its seat and a cord is knotted round it; loose pages that never got in lie beside, one weighted with a stone. This is the ninth expedition's shelf (guide §3.3, §12.1), where the pages the player picks up are filed. feelers opens the COLLECTION here. The pages stir in the wind (`stir`).",
  "tags": ["base"],
  "size": [132, 78],
